WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:10.551
These two export tasks have a combined result ready for review. A change to the date requirements now starts an update, with the earlier result still visible but dimmed.

00:00:11.506 --> 00:00:23.706
The update fails. Previously, the earlier comparison disappeared. Now it stays here beside the error, so it can still be read. Approval remains disabled, and Try again is available.

00:00:24.662 --> 00:00:37.142
Try again keeps the dimmed result while a fresh comparison runs. Once that succeeds, the new result includes time zones and can be approved. The earlier comparison stays available until its replacement arrives.
